OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely cloudy and unsettled
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain, mostly light
OL,7,Fat first but becoming heavier and more
OL,8,Fpersistent in places later. The Outer
OL,9,FHebrides may stay dry and bright.
OL,10,FFresh southeasterly winds around the
OL,11,Fcoasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy with
OL,14,Ffurther rain at times, with just a few
OL,15,Fdrier clearer spells in the northwest.
OL,16,FWinds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
