OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with some outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain, lasting most of the day in
OL,7,Fthe east, while the west will turn a
OL,8,Flittle brighter later with a few
OL,9,Fshowers.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FThursday bright with occasional
OL,13,Fshowers. Chance of rain on Friday,
OL,14,Fthen bright with showers again on
OL,15,FSaturday.
